// A block on the square 0..20 by 0..20 under a bicubic B-spline surface of 6 × 5 control points
// with a double knot.
//
// Refused: popkern's scripts make no surface from control points. A profile is a plane
// curve (lines, arcs, conics, splines), and every face comes from extruding,
// revolving, sweeping or lofting one, so there is no way to give the dome's B-spline surface.
throw "popkern's scripts make no surface from control points: profiles are plane curves, and no \
feature takes a B-spline surface";
